WEBVTT

00:00:04.382 --> 00:00:10.586
Freely leaving the contemplation room.

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:19.027
Sister Gray found out about a pet turtle
Patty secretly kept.

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:24.882
While protecting Patty, Candy managed
to upset sister Gray.

00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:27.188
Candice White Adley!

00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:32.428
You are banned from participating in the May festival,
during which you will be confined to the contemplation room!

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:43.403
Sister Gray is so mad... just what were you two up to?

00:00:43.979 --> 00:00:49.917
Sister Margaret... It was all my fault.
I got Candy in trouble, too...

00:00:50.537 --> 00:00:55.659
Patty, don't say that! I wanted to
see the contemplation rooms someday!

00:00:56.074 --> 00:00:57.245
Candy...

00:01:09.455 --> 00:01:11.212
This room is Patricia's.

00:01:13.802 --> 00:01:16.110
Candice, this one is yours.

00:01:16.111 --> 00:01:18.419
Patricia, give me that turtle.

00:01:18.926 --> 00:01:20.154
Yuli!

00:01:20.798 --> 00:01:26.095
Sister Margaret, leave Yuli to me!
I'm begging you!

00:01:26.622 --> 00:01:28.326
I'll write an apology for this...

00:01:28.614 --> 00:01:32.428
I'll make sure you don't get into trouble for this!
Therefore...

00:01:32.565 --> 00:01:35.065
Please! I'm begging you!

00:01:35.972 --> 00:01:42.132
I understand, Candice.
I believe you. I'll let you have Yuli.

00:01:42.559 --> 00:01:45.781
Thank you, sister Margaret!

00:01:48.194 --> 00:01:49.101
Candy!

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.831
Patty! Leave it to me!

00:02:06.316 --> 00:02:11.874
That's great, Yuli! I'm thinking about
asking Mr. Albert to take care of you.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.844
If he received my invitation to the May festival...
I'm sure he'll come!

00:02:18.486 --> 00:02:20.849
And then, I'll ask him to take care of you.

00:02:22.196 --> 00:02:23.510
May festival!

00:02:24.404 --> 00:02:28.219
Oh crap! I'll be locked up in here
during the whole festival!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.746
You're banned from participating in May festival!

00:02:33.271 --> 00:02:37.551
I wonder will Mr. Albert laugh when he
hears that I was banned from the festival.

00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:42.024
And grandfather William...

00:02:47.787 --> 00:02:50.454
Grandfather enabled me to study in this school...

00:02:50.744 --> 00:02:54.285
I wanted him to see how hard I'm working
on becoming a lady.

00:02:56.602 --> 00:03:01.933
When he hears that his foster-daugter was banned
from the festival,

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.472
...it might startle him and he could even die...

00:03:04.854 --> 00:03:08.586
And when I think of angry aunt Elroy...

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.539
You're a shame of the Adley family!
A disgrace!

00:03:16.928 --> 00:03:18.176
What should I do?

00:03:41.188 --> 00:03:42.171
Yuli!

00:03:42.172 --> 00:03:43.770
You're awake!

00:03:46.668 --> 00:03:50.544
Patty used to talk to you whenever she was lonely.

00:03:50.757 --> 00:03:54.856
Even though you can't answer,
you're a wonderful companion!

00:03:55.317 --> 00:03:57.009
It's because you're a living creature!

00:03:57.811 --> 00:03:59.199
Good morning, Patricia.

00:03:59.982 --> 00:04:01.212
Get out, quickly.

00:04:03.611 --> 00:04:04.972
Good morning, Candice!

00:04:05.983 --> 00:04:09.697
Good morning, sister Margaret!
You're here to let me out?

00:04:10.315 --> 00:04:12.583
I just brought you breakfast.

00:04:14.702 --> 00:04:18.173
I spoke to sister Gray about you...

00:04:20.097 --> 00:04:25.389
I already said, Patricia only for one night,
and Candice - until the May festival is over!

00:04:29.307 --> 00:04:30.760
I'm sorry, Candy.

00:04:32.018 --> 00:04:35.574
It's okay, Patty.
I'm not very lonely in here!

00:04:37.957 --> 00:04:38.910
Thank you.

00:05:01.127 --> 00:05:02.324
Waltz!

00:05:02.837 --> 00:05:05.226
Everyone is practicing for the May festival.

00:05:06.957 --> 00:05:11.778
Yuli! Are you a boy? Or a girl?

00:05:12.346 --> 00:05:13.599
Suits me both ways!

00:05:13.786 --> 00:05:15.096
Come!

00:05:17.005 --> 00:05:18.457
One, two, three...

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.372
And TURN!

00:05:27.526 --> 00:05:28.919
It fell out.

00:05:29.476 --> 00:05:30.865
What a piece of junk.

00:05:32.959 --> 00:05:36.348
Yuli, looks like we can escape from the attic!

00:05:37.602 --> 00:05:39.282
What a refreshing spring outside!

00:05:39.473 --> 00:05:43.219
I'll return before the next patrol.
I have plenty of time!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.393
Candy!

00:06:03.805 --> 00:06:05.716
What are you doing, Annie?

00:06:06.697 --> 00:06:08.273
Uh... I'm sorry!

00:06:10.037 --> 00:06:12.524
You just said "Candy", haven't you?

00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:17.727
Yes...! I wondered what's going on with her...

00:06:18.159 --> 00:06:21.429
She's locked up in the contemplation room.
She's probably crying her eyes out right now.

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:23.540
Good for her!

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:27.435
Candy... just how did you escape from that room?

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.139
Instead of Candy, think about the dance practice!

00:06:31.774 --> 00:06:35.939
She must be lonely now that her friend
can't watch over her anymore!

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:38.581
Keep an eye on that record player!

00:06:42.342 --> 00:06:47.526
Besides, Candy, now that you've escaped,
just where do you plan to go?

00:06:50.491 --> 00:06:52.638
Hey, stop!

00:06:53.308 --> 00:06:57.092
Mister, let's hurry to the Blue river zoo!

00:06:57.241 --> 00:07:01.965
All the way to Blue river?
You have the money to pay the fare, young lady?

00:07:02.335 --> 00:07:03.642
Of course!

00:07:03.979 --> 00:07:05.510
Alright then, hop in.

00:07:05.777 --> 00:07:08.798
I'm sorry, Mr. Albert, but you'll
have to pay the fare.

00:07:13.568 --> 00:07:17.081
Young lady, just what is that stone-thing?
Looks pretty important to you.

00:07:17.253 --> 00:07:19.636
That's right! It's very important to me!

00:07:20.761 --> 00:07:24.148
Yuli, you look just like a stone
with your legs hidden inside.

00:07:24.792 --> 00:07:26.280
Wow, balloons!

00:07:28.003 --> 00:07:30.447
Say, is that a street musician?

00:07:50.223 --> 00:07:53.181
Wow, that kid has a huge lollipop!

00:07:55.024 --> 00:07:58.736
Young lady, you seem to have been living
in some hellhole till now...

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.400
That's right! I was in jail!

00:08:03.456 --> 00:08:08.744
Lately I've been hearing about kid gangs but...
Maybe I let one of them into my carriage!

00:08:08.934 --> 00:08:13.325
Yeah, she has a cute face, but I
don't know what she could do!

00:08:13.725 --> 00:08:19.206
Maybe... If I turn into an empty street...
...she'll clobber me with that stone!

00:08:32.918 --> 00:08:35.127
-We're here!
-Thank you!

00:08:35.302 --> 00:08:39.620
Could you wait a bit? I'll call my friends
and we'll pay you the fare.

00:08:39.808 --> 00:08:41.690
-Friends?
-Yes!

00:08:43.514 --> 00:08:44.519
Well then.

00:08:48.739 --> 00:08:54.486
N..no! You don't have to! Don't call your friends,
I'll be on my way! I don't need you to pay the fare!

00:09:00.369 --> 00:09:02.293
Yuli, what was that about?

00:09:05.271 --> 00:09:08.685
He must have treated me 'cause I'm so cute!

00:09:21.562 --> 00:09:23.707
I wonder if I'll find Mr. Albert.

00:09:29.231 --> 00:09:30.415
Mr. Albert!

00:09:32.532 --> 00:09:33.491
Terry?

00:09:46.247 --> 00:09:47.594
Terry is laughing.

00:09:49.852 --> 00:09:52.842
He's laughing so heartily!
They must be having fun.

00:09:53.616 --> 00:09:57.761
Mr. Albert has the power to cheer up anyone.

00:09:58.459 --> 00:10:04.238
Yuli, since Mr. Albert is so good with animals,
I'm sure he'll be able to cheer you up, too!

00:10:14.728 --> 00:10:16.279
Good day, Mr. Albert.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.948
Candy!

00:10:18.367 --> 00:10:20.590
I had no idea that Terry is with you.

00:10:20.769 --> 00:10:22.482
Talk about the devil...

00:10:24.642 --> 00:10:30.502
-Candy, Terry and I have been talking about you.
-So that's why you two were laughing!

00:10:31.571 --> 00:10:36.582
No, Terry told me why he calls you "freckled Tarzan."

00:10:36.751 --> 00:10:41.106
So the two of you were
poking fun at me and laughing about it!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.021
You watched us?

00:10:46.313 --> 00:10:48.682
Gosh, he's so rude.

00:10:48.841 --> 00:10:51.454
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:10:52.196 --> 00:10:56.303
By the way, Candy, what's the matter with that turtle?

00:10:56.415 --> 00:10:57.691
That's right!

00:10:57.839 --> 00:11:02.025
Its name is Yuli!
I'd like to give it to you!

00:11:02.173 --> 00:11:03.113
To me?

00:11:03.913 --> 00:11:07.368
Yes. It's a precious friend of my friend.

00:11:07.521 --> 00:11:11.853
Friend's friend?
That's okay. Welcome, Yuli!

00:11:12.785 --> 00:11:13.816
I'm so glad!

00:11:13.967 --> 00:11:17.107
Hey, sunglasses, your break is over.

00:11:18.176 --> 00:11:23.433
I'm sorry, you two. I'll be done in two hours;
till then, why don't you two have some fun?

00:11:25.064 --> 00:11:26.888
Good for you, Yuli!

00:11:27.691 --> 00:11:30.784
I forgot something important!
The turtle!

00:11:32.389 --> 00:11:33.711
Be a good boy, okay?

00:11:35.464 --> 00:11:38.437
-You'll take good care of it, won't you?
-Of course!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:52.389
I thought I would have had so much to say
once I got the chance to see him.

00:11:53.137 --> 00:11:54.444
But I can't find any words.

00:11:56.179 --> 00:11:59.553
I only hear the sound of my beating heart.

00:12:13.531 --> 00:12:15.395
Let's go out, Candy.

00:12:15.825 --> 00:12:16.874
What?

00:12:22.769 --> 00:12:31.232
So many people are here. Families, couples...
Even groups of hikers...

00:12:34.657 --> 00:12:39.460
If I could bring the children from Pony's home...
...they would've been so glad!

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:51.018
Terry!

00:12:54.256 --> 00:12:57.205
I wonder... whom do we look alike?

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:00.092
Brother and sister?

00:13:00.627 --> 00:13:01.553
Or maybe...

00:13:02.101 --> 00:13:03.976
Maybe we look like a couple!

00:13:05.147 --> 00:13:06.609
That wouldn't be too far off!

00:13:06.631 --> 00:13:07.292
Candy!

00:13:07.293 --> 00:13:10.319
Candy, something in here looks exactly like you.

00:13:10.798 --> 00:13:11.669
What is it?

00:13:16.427 --> 00:13:18.858
When you make that face,
you resemble them even more.

00:13:24.456 --> 00:13:27.202
Instead of Freckled Tarzan, maybe
Freckled Monkey would suit you better?

00:13:28.954 --> 00:13:32.102
Don't you make fun of me!
You're gonna get some!

00:13:33.703 --> 00:13:35.088
Terry, you!

00:13:36.662 --> 00:13:38.631
Geez, where is he?

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.721
I wasn't really going to hurt him.

00:13:41.756 --> 00:13:42.368
Candy.

00:13:44.797 --> 00:13:45.622
Terry!

00:13:45.788 --> 00:13:46.629
Wanna share?

00:13:48.356 --> 00:13:49.346
Thank you.

00:13:49.635 --> 00:13:52.533
I thought you got scared of me and ran away.

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:54.233
No way.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.644
Alright!

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:12.201
Cute!

00:14:16.494 --> 00:14:18.189
By the way, how come you're here today?

00:14:19.087 --> 00:14:22.340
I escaped from the contemplation room.

00:14:22.479 --> 00:14:23.700
Contemplation room?

00:14:24.451 --> 00:14:26.123
You know, last night...

00:14:27.445 --> 00:14:29.443
Why, you stubborn old...!

00:14:38.439 --> 00:14:41.230
It's not very funny!

00:14:42.217 --> 00:14:45.319
Stubborn, you said?
I love this.

00:14:45.914 --> 00:14:48.101
Even I wouldn't have said such a thing!

00:14:48.226 --> 00:14:49.327
Miss freckles.

00:14:50.078 --> 00:14:54.982
And thus, I was banned from the May festival.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:56.974
That's my bad luck.

00:14:57.164 --> 00:14:59.398
I see, you won't be there.

00:15:00.615 --> 00:15:03.009
But May festival sounds like a lot of fun!

00:15:03.406 --> 00:15:07.290
Many flowers... candy... and the dance!

00:15:10.255 --> 00:15:14.327
Yeah, it really is a lot of fun!
They'll bake a cake this big!

00:15:15.153 --> 00:15:18.201
I'm so disappointed. I even invited Mr. Albert...

00:15:19.327 --> 00:15:20.914
How did you meet Mr. Albert?

00:15:21.378 --> 00:15:23.452
I met him back in America.

00:15:23.839 --> 00:15:29.070
While I was tending horses in Eliza's house,
one night I went out and he saved me.

00:15:32.673 --> 00:15:34.077
Help me!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.312
Help me!

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.205
Somebody!

00:15:51.963 --> 00:15:55.984
It looks like he always appears to help me
when I'm in trouble.

00:15:56.572 --> 00:15:57.951
He's such a good person!

00:15:59.171 --> 00:16:02.408
When Anthony died...
he came to console me.

00:16:04.579 --> 00:16:09.733
Candy, what do you plan to do after his death?

00:16:13.019 --> 00:16:16.686
Don't say that this weepy face and hesitant
thoughts are all that's left of you now.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:21.736
Lakewood was such a wonderful town!

00:16:22.716 --> 00:16:24.040
I'm sure...

00:16:26.131 --> 00:16:28.775
...that Anthony's roses are blooming now.

00:16:33.197 --> 00:16:34.020
Anthony?

00:16:34.592 --> 00:16:36.364
On that day, she mentioned the same name.

00:16:45.305 --> 00:16:46.329
Anthony...

00:16:48.661 --> 00:16:49.621
Anthony!

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:55.905
Who is Anthony?

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:06.476
On that day, on the ship...
I thought I'd seen Anthony.

00:17:08.971 --> 00:17:09.942
However...

00:17:12.078 --> 00:17:13.562
I was completely wrong.

00:17:16.597 --> 00:17:21.813
Anthony was a very kind boy who loved his roses.

00:17:24.613 --> 00:17:26.856
Good thing that I'm not like him.

00:17:27.347 --> 00:17:28.256
Terry!

00:17:29.116 --> 00:17:30.433
He grew roses?

00:17:30.859 --> 00:17:33.197
I'm sure he must have been a real wuss.

00:17:33.354 --> 00:17:36.559
Terry! That's rude! Anthony wasn't weak!

00:17:37.369 --> 00:17:44.260
He was a strong... masculine...
wonderful person.

00:17:45.284 --> 00:17:49.398
I see. And what happened with you
and that rose-kid?

00:17:49.578 --> 00:17:52.239
He dumped you in favor of his roses?

00:17:53.805 --> 00:17:55.337
What's up with that gaze?

00:17:59.267 --> 00:18:03.057
So instead of you, I'm sure he's in America
right now, fawning over his roses.

00:18:04.344 --> 00:18:05.381
Anthony is...

00:18:06.064 --> 00:18:07.128
Anthony is...

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.459
...dead!

00:18:09.888 --> 00:18:12.479
He fell off a horse.

00:18:16.054 --> 00:18:17.198
He's dead?

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:18.630
Fell off a horse?

00:18:19.565 --> 00:18:21.425
That means, on that night when I rode...

00:18:23.933 --> 00:18:25.681
Candy must be very afraid of horses.

00:18:27.063 --> 00:18:28.793
Don't get on that horse!

00:18:29.677 --> 00:18:31.431
Stop that horse!

00:18:37.483 --> 00:18:38.419
Candy.

00:18:39.186 --> 00:18:40.704
You liked Anthony that much?

00:18:45.699 --> 00:18:50.253
What a pity. At least, I can pray for
his happiness in the other world.

00:18:50.418 --> 00:18:51.239
Terry!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.103
Must you be so rude?

00:18:53.512 --> 00:18:55.303
Putting down Anthony was horrible of you!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.650
Terry!

00:18:56.651 --> 00:18:59.527
What's with that Anthony...
Those who die don't come back!

00:19:04.045 --> 00:19:05.112
Terry is horrible...

00:19:05.717 --> 00:19:08.682
Putting down Anthony...
I won't forgive you!

00:19:09.873 --> 00:19:13.717
As soon as he speaks up, he finds the
words to hurt one's feelings.

00:19:13.749 --> 00:19:14.924
What's the matter, Candy?

00:19:15.401 --> 00:19:16.531
Did Terry go back?

00:19:18.744 --> 00:19:21.097
Yeah...
That punk...

00:19:21.383 --> 00:19:23.843
He didn't really look like a punk to me.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:28.761
Ever since that night when I saved him,
he comes to see me from time to time.

00:19:29.046 --> 00:19:30.887
He's a punk to me!

00:19:31.028 --> 00:19:33.283
You two got into a fight?
Can't help it, then.

00:19:33.284 --> 00:19:34.443
Here's Yuli.

00:19:34.983 --> 00:19:36.057
Yuli!

00:19:36.248 --> 00:19:39.094
Mr. Albert, have you received my invitation?

00:19:39.818 --> 00:19:41.848
Yeah, for May festival?

00:19:41.917 --> 00:19:44.060
I'll be there for sure.
Thanks.

00:19:44.544 --> 00:19:49.575
Maybe I could borrow a new suit from a friend.
I need to dress up a bit!

00:19:50.629 --> 00:19:53.904
Uh, I was banned from the festival.

00:19:54.461 --> 00:19:55.822
Banned?

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.934
It was because of Yuli. I'm sorry.

00:19:59.135 --> 00:20:02.181
No point in going then, I guess...

00:20:03.192 --> 00:20:04.356
I'm sorry.

00:20:16.403 --> 00:20:18.883
Looks like I made it back
before they found out I was gone.

00:20:19.443 --> 00:20:22.865
I thought Mr. Albert would've laughed
after telling him what had happened...

00:20:23.006 --> 00:20:24.705
But he looked so disappointed.

00:20:26.652 --> 00:20:27.623
Kurin!

00:20:30.899 --> 00:20:34.044
Kurin, you've come to see me?

00:20:34.239 --> 00:20:37.350
I was worried that I'd have nobody to talk with
now that Yuli is gone!

00:20:37.536 --> 00:20:39.228
I'm so glad you're here!

00:20:41.363 --> 00:20:45.796
That's right. Until now, I've never felt the kind
of loneliness Patty had been facing...

00:20:46.242 --> 00:20:50.330
Because Mr. Albert, Stear and Archie
were always there for me.

00:20:50.331 --> 00:20:54.419
And now that I'm completely alone...
Kurin, you are there for me.

00:20:54.919 --> 00:20:59.971
That's why... that's why I'm not lonely, Kurin.
Thank you, Kurin!

00:21:01.774 --> 00:21:07.355
Candy was overjoyed to have Kurin at her side.

00:21:08.096 --> 00:21:14.534
And now that Kurin was next to her, Candy thought
that she wouldn't be so lonely during the May festival.

00:21:15.883 --> 00:21:20.188
To be continued...
